WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.020
- All right, everybody.

00:00:01.020 --> 00:00:02.520
We have reached the part of the show

00:00:02.520 --> 00:00:04.110
where I share something heartwarming

00:00:04.110 --> 00:00:05.490
from the internet that you may like.

00:00:05.490 --> 00:00:06.585
This is what I'm liking.

00:00:06.585 --> 00:00:09.630
(rock music)

00:00:09.630 --> 00:00:12.180
More men than ever are rocking nail art.

00:00:12.180 --> 00:00:15.720
Musicians like Harry Styles,
Bad Bunny, ASAP Rocky,

00:00:15.720 --> 00:00:17.550
all have amazing nails.

00:00:17.550 --> 00:00:19.800
So when a preschool boy
was told by his teacher

00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:23.310
that boys don't paint
their nails, shame on you.

00:00:23.310 --> 00:00:25.920
His dad had the best reaction.

00:00:25.920 --> 00:00:29.550
- Yesterday, my son came home
from school really upset,

00:00:29.550 --> 00:00:30.750
because his teacher told him

00:00:30.750 --> 00:00:33.633
that painting your
nails is only for girls.

00:00:35.100 --> 00:00:37.508
So today I'm taking 'em to the nail shop.

00:00:37.508 --> 00:00:38.684
- Yeah.

00:00:38.684 --> 00:00:40.037
- [Dad] Ooh.

00:00:40.037 --> 00:00:41.250
- Pink.

00:00:41.250 --> 00:00:42.083
- [Dad] Pick one.

00:00:42.083 --> 00:00:43.656
- Um, this one.

00:00:43.656 --> 00:00:44.657
- [Dad] Okay.

00:00:44.657 --> 00:00:46.977
(upbeat music)

00:00:46.977 --> 00:00:49.020
(audience cheering)

00:00:49.020 --> 00:00:50.370
- I swear that's my son, y'all.

00:00:50.370 --> 00:00:51.480
He's the same kid.

00:00:51.480 --> 00:00:53.850
And let's get Ashton and
his dad, Christian in here.

00:00:53.850 --> 00:00:54.963
What's up, y'all?

00:00:56.460 --> 00:00:57.660
- Hi.

00:00:57.660 --> 00:00:58.493
- What's up?

00:00:59.430 --> 00:01:01.920
So Ashton, first, let's see your nails.

00:01:01.920 --> 00:01:02.910
Do you like 'em?

00:01:02.910 --> 00:01:04.740
- Let's see it, bud, show 'em.

00:01:04.740 --> 00:01:05.693
- Oh, I love 'em.
- Yeah.

00:01:08.520 --> 00:01:12.630
Ashton, I have my son, he's
six and his name is Remy.

00:01:12.630 --> 00:01:15.750
Remy B, he makes me say
that, but he loves blue.

00:01:15.750 --> 00:01:17.190
His nails are blue as well.

00:01:17.190 --> 00:01:18.300
He loves blue nail polish.

00:01:18.300 --> 00:01:19.133
That's his favorite thing.

00:01:19.133 --> 00:01:21.240
So Christian, you say that you saw this

00:01:21.240 --> 00:01:24.030
as a way to take something sad
and make it positive, right?

00:01:24.030 --> 00:01:27.119
- These nails are this blue.

00:01:27.119 --> 00:01:28.500
- Yeah, absolutely.
- Yeah.

00:01:28.500 --> 00:01:31.650
- So, my family's always been,
you know, a little different.

00:01:31.650 --> 00:01:33.030
And we love living in color.

00:01:33.030 --> 00:01:35.916
So, when Ashton came home upset

00:01:35.916 --> 00:01:38.880
I was a little upset myself,
you know what I mean?

00:01:38.880 --> 00:01:40.620
When she said, "It's just for girls."

00:01:40.620 --> 00:01:41.910
I was like, "What?"

00:01:41.910 --> 00:01:44.070
But I'm also a teacher

00:01:44.070 --> 00:01:45.894
and I look for these teaching moments.

00:01:45.894 --> 00:01:47.940
I didn't wanna go full Karen

00:01:47.940 --> 00:01:50.580
and go up to the school all mad.

00:01:50.580 --> 00:01:52.320
So instead, I took him to the nail shop,

00:01:52.320 --> 00:01:54.510
he picked out hot pink himself.

00:01:54.510 --> 00:01:55.410
We painted our nails

00:01:55.410 --> 00:01:56.940
and we had a good time and it was awesome.

00:01:56.940 --> 00:01:57.773
- I love it.

00:01:57.773 --> 00:02:01.290
First of all, thank you so
much for being a teacher.

00:02:01.290 --> 00:02:04.560
First of all, that's an amazing
thing to do for everyone.

00:02:04.560 --> 00:02:05.393
- Dad.

00:02:05.393 --> 00:02:06.660
- Yeah.

00:02:06.660 --> 00:02:08.820
Well, I was a little
upset when I heard that

00:02:08.820 --> 00:02:10.590
'cause somebody told my son as well,

00:02:10.590 --> 00:02:12.900
that you're a boy, you
can't wear nail polish.

00:02:12.900 --> 00:02:15.660
And I let him pick
whatever color he wanted.

00:02:15.660 --> 00:02:16.590
I was like, what?

00:02:16.590 --> 00:02:18.900
This is not the fifties.

00:02:18.900 --> 00:02:19.733
Okay.

00:02:19.733 --> 00:02:22.380
But Christian, you did
another thing off camera

00:02:22.380 --> 00:02:23.850
that deserves just as much attention.

00:02:23.850 --> 00:02:25.620
So, tell us about that.

00:02:25.620 --> 00:02:28.920
- Okay, so ultimately I
decided not to go complain

00:02:28.920 --> 00:02:30.810
to the school administration, right?

00:02:30.810 --> 00:02:32.491
So I went and I talked to her, right?

00:02:32.491 --> 00:02:33.960
Instead of canceling her.

00:02:33.960 --> 00:02:35.700
So many people on TikTok were like--

00:02:35.700 --> 00:02:36.600
- Hi, Kelly.

00:02:36.600 --> 00:02:38.040
- Trying to go for her job

00:02:38.040 --> 00:02:40.260
and like trying to have her fired.

00:02:40.260 --> 00:02:41.910
But that's really not
me, you know what I mean?

00:02:41.910 --> 00:02:43.260
I think we all just need to talk

00:02:43.260 --> 00:02:44.580
to each other a little bit more.

00:02:44.580 --> 00:02:48.180
- That's the coolest thing ever, man.

00:02:48.180 --> 00:02:51.840
And what a way to teach your
son how to react, you know?

00:02:51.840 --> 00:02:52.890
That's the most important thing.

00:02:52.890 --> 00:02:54.150
It's things are gonna happen to us,

00:02:54.150 --> 00:02:55.980
but it's how we react is who we are.

00:02:55.980 --> 00:02:56.970
Thank you so much.

00:02:56.970 --> 00:02:58.800
Ashton, I love your nails.

00:02:58.800 --> 00:03:00.300
I love your nails as well, Christian.

00:03:00.300 --> 00:03:01.719
- Say thank you.

00:03:01.719 --> 00:03:04.380
- I'm liking y'alls post right now.

00:03:04.380 --> 00:03:05.220
And that's not all.

00:03:05.220 --> 00:03:06.900
Our season long partner Pilot Pen,

00:03:06.900 --> 00:03:09.390
makers of G2, the go-to pen
of "The Kelly Clarkson Show"

00:03:09.390 --> 00:03:11.310
wanna celebrate families just like y'all.

00:03:11.310 --> 00:03:13.740
So they're gonna be writing
you a check for $,000.

00:03:13.740 --> 00:03:14.663
How's that sound?

00:03:14.663 --> 00:03:16.482
(audience cheering)

00:03:16.482 --> 00:03:17.315
- What?

00:03:18.682 --> 00:03:19.530
What?

00:03:19.530 --> 00:03:21.243
- That's a lot of nail polish.

00:03:25.410 --> 00:03:26.520
Thank you guys so much

00:03:26.520 --> 00:03:28.350
and thank you to all our guests this hour,

00:03:28.350 --> 00:03:32.010
Henry Winkler, Melissa
Barrera, Brian Hart Hoffman,

00:03:32.010 --> 00:03:33.420
Kay Adams, and Jackson Dean.

00:03:33.420 --> 00:03:34.253
Y'all have a great day,

00:03:34.253 --> 00:03:36.090
and if it's not, try and change it.

